#: kcm/kupkcm.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<h2>Backup programs are missing</h2><p>Before you can activate any backup "
"plan you need to install either of</p><ul><li>bup, for versioned "
"backups</li><li>rsync, for synchronized backups</li></ul>"
